BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:season-24-twilight-trails@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Season: Twilight Trails
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260908T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261201T100000
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Pokémon GO: Twilight Trails!\nIn Pokémon GO\, Seas
 ons are periods of time that feature new events\, Pokémon debuts\, and su
 rprises that all follow a certain theme. As the Seasons change\, you may f
 ind different Pokémon appearing in your area and hatching from Eggs. Make
  sure to explore during each in-game Season to collect and train as many d
 ifferent Pokémon as you can! You’ll also enjoy special bonuses as you d
 o.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n▸ GO Pass Major Milestone Bonuses\nReach Ma
 jor Milestones on your GO Pass to unlock the following bonuses. Once unloc
 ked\, these bonuses will last until the current GO Pass ends!\n\n▸ Rank 
 1\n• One guaranteed Candy XL when trading Pokémon for Trainers level 31
  and above\n• One additional Candy for trading Pokémon\n\n▸ Rank 25\n
 • Increased limits on opening Gifts\, receiving Gifts from PokéStop and
  Gym Photo Discs\, and storing Gifts\n\n▸ Rank 50\n• 2× Daily Adventu
 re Incense duration\n\n▸ Rank 75\n• Increased XP and Stardust from hat
 ching Eggs\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Debuts\nMore Pokémon o
 riginally discovered in the Paldea region\, which was featured in the Pok
 émon Scarlet and Pokémon Violet games for Nintendo Switch\, have been sp
 otted in Pokémon GO!\nBe on the lookout for Maschiff\, Mabosstiff\, and m
 ore!\nPokémon: Maschiff\, Mabosstiff\n\n▸ Mega-Evolved Pokémon\nWhere 
 Pokémon GO Fest 2026: Mega Finale ends\, a new trail begins! Gather ‘ro
 und for the Mega Evolution debuts of Staraptor\, Chandelure\, and more dur
 ing Twilight Trails.\nStay tuned for more details on how to continue your 
 Mega Evolution journey with the Mega Squads event\, September Community Da
 y Classic\, and more!\n\n▸ Max Pokémon Debuts\nDynamax Rhyhorn\, Dynama
 x Sneasel\, Dynamax Sizzlipede\, and more will make their way into Max Bat
 tles throughout the Season. Keep an eye out for new Dynamax Pokémon at Po
 wer Spots!\nDynamax Uxie\, Dynamax Mesprit\, and Dynamax Azelf will appear
  in a Max Battle Day during Twilight Trails.\nPokémon: Rhyhorn\, Sneasel\
 , Uxie\, Mesprit\, Azelf\, Sizzlipede\n\n▸ Daily Discoveries\nThroughout
  Twilight Trails\, different days of the week will include a Daily Discove
 ry experience. These will be active between 12:00 a.m. and 11:59 p.m. loca
 l time unless otherwise stated. Daily Discoveries may change as Scopely Ex
 plore experiments with how to make the best experience.\nPlease note: Dail
 y Discoveries will not be available during the week of global GO Fest\, GO
  Wild Area\, and GO Tour events. Daily Discoveries will not take place fro
 m November 9 through November 15\, 2026.\n\n▸ Community Days\nMark your 
 calendar! Twilight Trails will have Community Day events on the following 
 dates.\n• September 12 — September Community Day Classic\n• October 
 10 — October Community Day\n• November 21 — November Community Day\n
 \n▸ GO Pass\nGO Pass\, a limited-time progression track\, will be availa
 ble during Twilight Trails! Complete Pass Tasks to earn GO Points to incre
 ase your rank and earn rewards.\n…\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\n▸ Wild Pok
 émon Encounters\nAs the Seasons change\, you may find different Pokémon 
 appearing in your area. Explore during Twilight Trails to see what discove
 ries await!\n\n━━ EGGS ━━\nHere are some of the Pokémon hatching 
 from Eggs this season.\nThere are more Pokémon appearing in Eggs than the
  ones listed.\n\n▸ In 2 km Eggs\nPokémon: Elekid\, Magby\, Azurill\n\n
 ▸ In 5 km Eggs\nRegional: Mime Jr. is exclusive to Eggs obtained in Euro
 pe.\nPokémon: Mime Jr.\, Munchlax\, Larvesta\, Sizzlipede\, Snom\, Indeed
 ee (Male)\, Indeedee (Female)\, Fidough\, Maschiff\n\n▸ In 5 km Eggs fro
 m Adventure Sync Rewards\nPokémon: Tyrogue\, Sableye\, Budew\n\n▸ In 7 
 km Eggs\nPokémon: Galarian Meowth\, Galarian Zigzagoon\, Galarian Stunfis
 k\n\n▸ In 7 km Eggs From Route Rewards\nThis type of Egg is obtained fro
 m Mateo’s Gift Exchange at the end of a Route.\nPokémon: Galarian Slowp
 oke\, Hisuian Sneasel\, Galarian Corsola\n\n▸ In 10 km Eggs\nPokémon: D
 ratini\, Honedge\, Impidimp\n\n▸ In 10 km Eggs from Adventure Sync Rewar
 ds\nPokémon: Bagon\, Druddigon\, Drampa\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/even
 ts/season-24-twilight-trails/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/season-24-twilight-trails/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
