BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pokemon-x-adidas-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:adidas × Pokémon Timed Research
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260925T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20270115T200000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the adidas × Pokémon collection with Timed Research
  at participating adidas and retail stores worldwide!\nResearch is availab
 le starting September 25\, 2026\, at 10:00 a.m. local time\, through Janua
 ry 15\, 2027\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Par
 ticipating adidas Store Locations\nVisit a participating location and open
  Pokémon GO to receive the research.\nSearch for a store\, mall\, or city
  in the store name\, or use your location to explore nearby stores. Select
  Gyms or PokéStops to filter the map.\nThe interactive map will load when
  it is near the screen.\nOpen the official map\n\n▸ adidas Shoes\nComple
 te your outfit! Trainers worldwide can redeem offer code ADIDASxPOKEMON th
 rough the Pokémon GO Web Store to get a pair of adidas shoes for their av
 atar.\nThis offer code can be redeemed until Friday\, January 15\, 2027.\n
 \n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nThis Timed Research has three pages. Complete th
 e tasks to earn adidas avatar items\, Lucario Candy\, Lucario Mega Energy\
 , XP\, Stardust\, and an encounter with Lucario. If you’re lucky\, you m
 ay encounter a Shiny Lucario!\nObtain the research by January 15\, 2027\, 
 at 8:00 p.m. local time. Complete all tasks and claim all rewards before F
 ebruary 13\, 2027\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/
 events/pokemon-x-adidas-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-x-adidas-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pokemon-tcg-30th-celebration@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon TCG: 30th Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260927T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261020T220000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the release of Pokémon TCG: 30th Celebration!\nVisit
  participating Target\, Best Buy\, and GameStop locations in the United St
 ates for Mega Raids and Timed Research.\nThe event runs from September 27\
 , 2026\, at 10:00 a.m. to October 20\, 2026\, at 10:00 p.m. local time.\n\
 n━━ RAIDS ━━\nMega Gengar will appear more often in Mega Raids at 
 participating stores. The Gengar encountered after these raids may be Shin
 y.\n\n▸ Appearing in Mega Raids\nPokémon: Mega Gengar\n\n━━ RESEARC
 H ━━\nOpen Pokémon GO at a participating store to obtain the research
  by October 20\, 2026\, at 10:00 p.m. local time. Complete its tasks and c
 laim all rewards before November 20\, 2026\, at 10:00 p.m. local time.\nCo
 mplete three pages of tasks to earn Gastly\, Haunter\, and Gengar encounte
 rs\, Berries\, Poké Balls\, an Incubator\, 50 Gastly Candy\, and two Luck
 y Eggs.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-tcg-30th-celebration/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-tcg-30th-celebration/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:world-space-week-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:World Space Week 2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261004T000000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261010T235900
DESCRIPTION:Blast off with Astronaut Pikachu during World Space Week! This 
 new costumed Pokémon makes its Pokémon GO debut in raids and free Timed 
 Research.\nThis global event is part of a collaboration between the Europe
 an Space Agency and The Pokémon Company.\nWorld Space Week takes place fr
 om Sunday\, October 4\, 2026\, at 12:00 a.m. to Saturday\, October 10\, 20
 26\, at 11:59 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Deb
 ut\nAstronaut Pikachu will appear for the first time in Pokémon GO! Encou
 nter it in one-star raids or through free Timed Research during this event
 .\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ One-Star Raids\nAstronaut Pikachu will appea
 r in one-star raids. If you’re lucky\, you might encounter a Shiny one!\
 nPokémon: Astronaut Pikachu\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nFree Timed Researc
 h will be available during the event. Complete the tasks to earn an encoun
 ter with Astronaut Pikachu and other rewards.\nTimed Research tasks must b
 e completed and all rewards claimed by Monday\, October 12\, 2026\, at 11:
 59 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nShiny Astronaut Pikachu will b
 e available when the costume debuts. If you’re lucky\, you might encount
 er one in raids or from Timed Research!\nPokémon: Astronaut Pikachu\n\n
 🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/world-space-week-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/world-space-week-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
