 ▸ Great League: Mega Edition\n• Pokémon must be at or below 1\,500 CP
  to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are allowed.\n\n▸ Ultra League: Me
 ga Edition\n• Pokémon must be at or below 2\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega
 -Evolved Pokémon are allowed.\n\n▸ Master League: Mega Edition\n• No 
 CP limit.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are allowed.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck
