BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:yveltal-in-5-star-raid-battles-october-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Yveltal in 5-star Raid Battles
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261007T060000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261013T220000
DESCRIPTION:Yveltal will be in five-star raid battles from October 7\, 2026
  to October 13\, 2026.\n\n▸ Raid Hours\nThere will also be a Raid Hour f
 eaturing Yveltal from 6:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. local time on October 7.\n\n
 ━━ RAIDS ━━\nYveltal will be in five-star raid battles.\nPokémon:
