BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:october-communityday2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Zorua Community Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261010T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261010T170000
DESCRIPTION:Zorua\, the Tricky Fox Pokémon\, will be featured during Octob
 er Community Day!\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased Spawns\n• 3x C
 atch XP\n• 3-hour Incense\n• 1-hour Lures*\n• 2x Catch Candy\n• 2x
  Chance for Trainers level 31 and up to receive Candy XL from catching Pok
 émon\n• One additional Special Trade can be made for a maximum of two f
 or the day*\n• Trades made will require 50% less Stardust*\n* While most
  bonuses are only active during the three hours of the event (2:00 p.m. to
  5:00 p.m. local time)\, these bonuses will be active from 2:00 p.m. to 9:
 00 p.m. local time.\nThe three-hour Incense bonus excludes Daily Adventure
  Incense and the one-hour Lure bonus excludes Golden Lure Modules.\n\n━
 ━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Featured Attack\nEvolve Zorua during the event or
  up to four hours afterwards to get a Zoroark that knows the Fast Attack S
 ucker Punch.\n\n▸ Sucker Punch (Dark-type)\n• Trainer Battles: 8 power
 \n• Gyms and raids: 5 power\n\n▸ Photobomb\nTake a few snapshots durin
 g Community Day for a surprise! During the event you can snap an AR Photo 
 and get photobombed by Zorua.\nPokémon: Zorua\n\n▸ Lure Module Bonus\nF
 rom 2:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time\, Zorua will have a very high chance
  of appearing at PokéStops with active regular Lure Modules.\nZorua attra
 cted to regular Lure Modules will still have an increased chance to be Shi
 ny and may have a Special Background. That’s more chances to encounter t
 he featured Pokémon even after the event hours!\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\n
 Zorua will appear more frequently in the wild.\nZorua will be disguised as
  your Buddy. If you change your Buddy to Zorua\, there will be no transfor
 mation animation.\nAlternatively\, if you fast catch\, you can set your Bu
 ddy to a large Pokémon to make it easier to land Excellent Throws.\nZorua
  in the wild may also have a Special Background.\nPokémon: Zorua\n\n━
 ━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Tasks\nOctober Community Day–the
 med Field Research will be available! Catch Zorua to earn rewards such as 
 Stardust\, Ultra Balls\, additional encounters with Zorua\, and more! You 
 may even find Field Research that leads to encounters with Zorua that have
  a Special Background—if you’re lucky!\n• Catch 3 Zorua → Zorua\, 
 Great Ball ×5\, Ultra Ball ×2\, Pinap Berry ×2\, Stardust ×500\nThe fo
 llowing tasks will have encounters with Special Backgrounds.\n• Catch 5 
 Pokemon while in a Party → Zorua\n• Catch 50 Pokemon → Zorua\nFor US
 $1.99 (or the equivalent pricing tier in your local currency)\, you’ll b
 e able to access the Zorua Community Day–exclusive Special Research. Com
 plete this research for even more rewards\, including the following:\n• 
 3 encounters with Zorua that have a Special Background (at the end of each
  page)\n• Additional encounters with Zorua\n• 1 Premium Battle Pass\n
 • 1 Rare Candy XL\n• And even more goodies!\n\n▸ Community Ambassado
 r Check-In Timed Research\nCheck in at a Community Ambassador event to rec
 eive Timed Research with Zorua encounters featuring a Special Background a
 nd other premium item rewards. Find a nearby meetup on the Pokémon GO eve
 nt map.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nShiny Zorua will be available! Trainers wi
 ll have an increased chance of encountering Shiny Zorua during Community D
 ay.\nPokémon: Zorua\, Zoroark\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/october
 -communityday2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/october-communityday2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
