 ased chance of receiving 2 km Eggs from spinning PokéStops\n*These bonuse
 s do not stack with bonuses from other Pokémon GO events or GO Passes.\n\
 n▸ Ticketed Bonus\nThe optional paid Timed Research ticket grants the fo
 llowing bonus during the event.\n• 1/4 Egg Hatch Distance*\n*This bonus 
 does not stack with bonuses from other Pokémon GO events or GO Passes.\n\
 n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Featured Pokémon\nSandile will hatch more fr
