SUMMARY:GBL: Ultra League\, Master League: Mega Edition\, and Fantasy Cup: 
 Great League Edition
DTSTART:20261020T200000Z
DTEND:20261027T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Ultra League\, Master League: Mega Edition\, and Fantasy Cu
 p: Great League Edition will run from October 20\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. to 
