BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pokemon-go-city-safari-boston-2026-rescheduled@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO City Safari: Boston (Rescheduled)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261024T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261025T180000
DESCRIPTION:Boston City Safari will run globally for current ticket holders
  on October 24–25\, 2026\, from 10 am to 6 pm local time daily. Keep you
 r ticket to participate\; no action is needed.\nOfficial announcement\n\n
 ━━ BONUSES ━━\n▸ Ticket Holder Bonuses\nThe original event bonus
 es apply worldwide during event hours.\n• Increased Shiny chance\n• Fo
 ur-hour Lure Modules (excluding Golden Lure Modules)\n• Up to five Speci
 al Trades\n• Half Stardust cost for trades\n• Tiny Compass buddy souve
 nir\n• Eight-hour Party Play\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Eevee wearin
 g an explorer hat\nSupplementary Special Research requires spinning PokéS
 tops in Boston and awards up to nine explorer-hat Eevee encounters with a 
 Boston Location Background per ticketed day. Log in anywhere between Octob
 er 24\, 2026\, and October 23\, 2028\, to claim it.\nPokémon: Explorer Ee
 vee\nThere is no Boston GO Stamp Rally.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe origi
 nally announced wild Pokémon will appear globally during event hours.\nPo
 kémon: Jigglypuff\, Abra\, Slowpoke\, Totodile\, Mareep\, Marill\, Hoppip
 \, Unown B\, Unown L\, Unown M\, Unown R\, Stantler\, Miltank\, Wingull\, 
 Baltoy\, Buizel\, Lillipup\, Petilil\, Yamask\, Gothita\, Orange Flower Fl
 abébé\, Binacle\, Clauncher\, Hawlucha\, Mudbray\, Oranguru\, Komala\, F
 lamigo\n\n━━ EGGS ━━\n▸ In 7 km Eggs\nPokémon: Orange Flower Fl
 abébé\, Hawlucha\, Mudbray\, Komala\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field
  Research Tasks\nThese are the known event-exclusive Field Research tasks.
 \n• Catch 5 Pokémon → Stardust ×1000\n• Catch 15 Pokémon → Mudb
 ray\n• Catch 20 Pokémon → Rare Candy ×1\n• Catch 5 different speci
 es of Pokémon → Mudbray\n• Take a snapshot of your buddy → Stardust
  ×1000\nAfter completing the first step\, choose double Incense\, Star Pi
 ece\, or Lucky Egg duration for the remainder of your ticketed session.\n\
 n▸ Double Incense Duration\nChoose this bonus to double Incense duration
  for the remainder of your ticketed session.\n\n▸ Double Star Piece Dura
 tion\nChoose this bonus to double Star Piece duration for the remainder of
  your ticketed session.\n\n▸ Double Lucky Egg Duration\nChoose this bonu
 s to double Lucky Egg duration for the remainder of your ticketed session.
 \nSpin different PokéStops or Gyms in Boston to encounter Eevee wearing a
 n explorer hat with a Boston Location Background. Day 2 has the same tasks
  and rewards as Day 1.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-city
 -safari-boston-2026-rescheduled/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-city-safari-boston-2026-reschedu
 led/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
