UID:dynamax-uxie-mesprit-azelf-max-battle-day-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Dynamax Uxie\, Mesprit\, and Azelf Max Battle Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261024T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261024T170000
DESCRIPTION:The Dynamax Uxie\, Mesprit\, and Azelf Max Battle Day event wil
 l take place on October 24\, 2026 from 2 pm to 5 pm local time.\n\n━━ 
 BONUSES ━━\nThe following bonuses will be active during the event.\n
 • Max Particle collection limit increased to 1\,600\n• All Power Spots
  will host Dynamax Battles\n• Power Spots will refresh more frequently\n
 • Additional Power Spots will be active\n• 8× Max Particles from Powe
 r Spots\n• Up to three Special Trades for the day\n• From October 23 a
 t 5:00 p.m. to October 24 at 8:00 p.m. PDT (GMT −7)\, the daily Remote R
 aid limit will increase from 10 to 20\nThe following bonuses will be activ
 e on October 24\, 2026\, from 12:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n• 2×
  Max Particles from exploring*\n• 1/4 Adventuring distance to receive Ma
 x Particles**\n*Trainers can collect Max Particles via the Nearby menu eac
 h day by exploring. Adventure Sync can help make sure your distance counts
 ! Keep an eye on the Nearby menu for the icon that shows when Max Particle
 s are ready to collect.\n**For these bonuses to apply\, Trainers must firs
 t collect all Max Particles available in the Nearby menu.\n\n▸ Event Tic
 ket\nFor US$4.99 (or the equivalent pricing tier in your local currency)\,
  you’ll be able to access event-exclusive Timed Research.\nTimed Researc
 h rewards include the following.\n• 1 Max Mushroom\n• 25\,000 XP\n• 
 6\,400 Max Particles\nYou’ll also receive the following bonus.\n• 2× 
 XP from Max Battles\nThis Timed Research will be effective on Saturday\, O
 ctober 24\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ FEATU
 RES ━━\n▸ Dynamax Debuts\nUxie\, Mesprit\, and Azelf debut in five-s
 tar Max Battles in their respective regions:\nPokémon: Uxie\, Mesprit\, A
 zelf\nUxie: Asia-Pacific. Mesprit: Europe\, the Middle East\, Africa\, and
  India. Azelf: the Americas and Greenland.\n\n▸ Where can I find Max Bat
 tles?\nMax Battles appear at Power Spots and require teamwork. Use the Pok
 émon GO Map to find active battles and locations where battles may appear
  during the event.\nYou can also check nearby events for community meetups
  hosted by Community Ambassadors\, or find your community to coordinate wi
 th other Trainers.\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nFor US$4.99 (or the equivale
 nt pricing tier in your local currency)\, you’ll be able to access event
 -exclusive Timed Research\, which rewards 1 Max Mushroom\, 25\,000 XP\, 6\
 ,400 Max Particles\, and 2× XP from Max Battles.\nThe Timed Research is a
 vailable on Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. loc
 al time.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nYou may encounter Shiny Uxie\, Mesprit\, 
 or Azelf after winning a Max Battle.\nPokémon: Uxie\, Mesprit\, Azelf\n\n
 🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/dynamax-uxie-mesprit-azelf-max-battle-day
 -2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/dynamax-uxie-mesprit-azelf-max-battle-day-2
 026/
