 PDT (10:30 p.m. EDT) for 30 minutes to earn a code for exclusive Timed Res
 earch. Complete the research to receive a Pokémon Night Out baseball jers
 ey for your avatar.\nThe broadcast end time and the code and Timed Researc
 h expiration dates have not been announced.\n\n▸ How to use Twitch Drops
 \nYou can check your Twitch Drop progress by clicking the chest icon in th
 e chat.\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nWatch the broadcast for 30 minutes to u
 nlock this two-step Timed Research. Complete it to earn the Pokémon Night
  Out Baseball Jersey avatar item\, XP\, Stardust\, and an encounter with U
 mbreon.\nThe exact completion deadline has not been confirmed. Complete al
 l tasks and claim all rewards before the in-game timer expires.\n\n🔗 ht
