DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon Night Out 2026 - Los Angeles
DTSTART:20261025T023000Z
DTEND:20261025T065959Z
DESCRIPTION:Unconfirmed Pokémon GO hours: The time shown is based on the P
 okémon Night Out concert schedule. Pokémon GO gameplay hours have not be
 en confirmed\, and the event may run at different times.\nCelebrate Pokém
 on Night Out with special Pokémon GO gameplay for attendees at the venue!
 \nDate: October 24\, 2026 Location: Intuit Dome\, Los Angeles\, USA Night 
 Out show starts: 7:30 p.m. PDT (unconfirmed for Pokémon GO) Doors open: 6
 :00 p.m. PDT End time: To be announced\nThe Intuit Dome listing gives the 
 show start time\, and Ticketmaster lists the doors-open time.\n\n▸ Relat
 ed Events\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\nAttendees can enjoy the following bonu
 s during the event.\n• Lure Modules activated during the event last for 
 one hour\, excluding Golden Lure Modules\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThese Po
 kémon will appear more often in the wild at the event venue.\nPokémon: G
 astly\, Voltorb\, Alolan Marowak\, Hoothoot\, Murkrow\, Houndour\, Electri
 ke\, Carvanha\, Shinx\, Zorua\, Joltik\, Froakie\, Dedenne\, Rookidee\nYou
  may also encounter these rarer Pokémon.\nPokémon: Unown P\, Unown N\, U
 nown O\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\nPikachu and Gengar caught from these event 
 raids will have a Los Angeles Location Background.\n\n▸ One-Star Raids\n
 Pokémon: Pikachu\n\n▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Gengar\nBoth raid Pok
 émon can be Shiny.\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Timed Research\nOpen Po
 kémon GO at the venue to receive up to two Timed Research opportunities. 
 Rewards include encounters with event-themed Pokémon\, such as Low Key Fo
 rm or Amped Form Toxtricity\, and a Pokémon Night Out baseball jersey ava
 tar item.\n\n▸ Featured Research Encounters\nPokémon: Toxtricity (Low K
 ey Form)\, Toxtricity (Amped Form)\nIf you already claimed the avatar item
  Timed Research through the Los Angeles Twitch livestream\, you will not r
 eceive that research again.\nComplete this two-step Timed Research to earn
  the Pokémon Night Out Baseball Jersey avatar item\, XP\, Stardust\, and 
 an encounter with Umbreon.\n\n▸ Branching Timed Research\nChoose Low Key
  Form or Amped Form. Your choice determines which form of Toxtricity you
 ’ll encounter.\n\n▸ Choose Low Key Form\nComplete these tasks to earn 
 an encounter with Low Key Form Toxtricity\, 2\,026 XP\, and 2\,026 Stardus
 t.\n\n▸ Choose Amped Form\nComplete these tasks to earn an encounter wit
 h Amped Form Toxtricity\, 2\,026 XP\, and 2\,026 Stardust.\n\n🔗 https:/
 /leekduck.com/events/pokemon-night-out-los-angeles-2026/
