BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:halloween-2026-part-1@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Halloween 2026 Part I
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261027T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261101T100000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Halloween with the debut of Pikachu wearing a hat and
  capelet\, Zubat wearing a top hat\, and Sinistea wearing a bow! Discover 
 spooky surprises in the wild and unlock Candy and Stardust bonuses with th
 e event GO Pass.\nHalloween 2026 Part I runs from Tuesday\, October 27\, a
 t 10:00 a.m. to Sunday\, November 1\, 2026\, at 10:00 a.m. local time.\nTh
 e celebration continues in Halloween 2026 Part II\, featuring Shiny Greava
 rd’s debut and Mega Sableye’s new Super Max level.\n\n━━ BONUSES 
 ━━\nReach Major Milestones on GO Pass: Halloween 2026 to unlock these 
 bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 10\n• 2× Candy for catching Pokémon\n
 • GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Candy for catching Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 2 – Rank
  20\n• 2× Stardust for catching Pokémon\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Stard
 ust for catching Pokémon\nBonus Tasks for this GO Pass arrive with Hallow
 een 2026 Part II.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Debuts\nThe foll
 owing costumed Pokémon make their Pokémon GO debuts.\nPokémon: Pikachu 
 wearing a hat and capelet\, Zubat wearing a top hat\, Sinistea wearing a b
 ow\n\n▸ Trick or Treat!\nLook for spooky surprises left by mischievous P
 okémon in the wild. Tap them for a chance to receive one of the following
  rewards\, including Rare Candy or encounters with costumed Gengar and Dri
 fblim if you’re lucky!\nPokémon: Pikachu Candy ×6\, Zubat Candy ×6\, 
 Sinistea Candy ×6\, Vulpix wearing a Spooky Festival costume\, Piplup wea
 ring a Halloween Mischief costume\, Zubat wearing a top hat\, Noibat weari
 ng a headband\, Drifblim wearing a Halloween Mischief costume\, Gengar wea
 ring a Tricks & Treats costume\, Rare Candy ×1\nThe tappables appear as p
 urple-and-orange gift boxes on the map.\n\n▸ Lavender Town Music and Hal
 loween Decor\nA Lavender Town music remix will play nightly during the Hal
 loween event. You can also listen to it on YouTube.\nDuring both parts of 
 the event\, Pokémon encounters\, PokéStops\, and Gyms will have Hallowee
 n decorations.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following event-themed Pokémo
 n are appearing in the wild.\nPokémon: Zubat wearing a top hat\, Piplup w
 earing a Halloween Mischief costume\, Noibat wearing a headband\, Pumpkabo
 o\, Duskull\, Misdreavus\, Drifblim wearing a Halloween Mischief costume\,
  Vulpix wearing a Spooky Festival costume\, Gengar wearing a Tricks & Trea
 ts costume\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ One-Star Raids\nThe following Poké
 mon will appear in one-star raids.\nPokémon: Pikachu wearing a hat and ca
 pelet\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Resear
 ch\nComplete event-themed Field Research tasks for encounters with Pikachu
  wearing a hat and capelet\, Zubat wearing a top hat\, Sinistea wearing a 
 bow\, Noibat wearing a headband\, and more!\n• Catch 13 Ghost‑type Pok
 émon → Halloween Piplup\, Headband Noibat\, Zubat wearing a top hat\n
 • Make 6 Nice Throws → Pumpkaboo (Small)\, Pumpkaboo (Average)\, Pumpk
 aboo (Large)\, Pumpkaboo (Super)\, Duskull\, Misdreavus\n• Win a raid 
 → Zubat wearing a top hat\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n• Win 3 raids → 
 Pikachu wearing a hat and capelet\nFree Timed Research will be available d
 uring the event. Its tasks will be automatically completed for all Trainer
 s.\nRewards include:\n• 6 Rare Candies\n• An encounter with Pikachu we
 aring a hat and capelet\, which can be Shiny if you’re lucky!\nClaim all
  rewards before Sunday\, November 1\, 2026\, at 10:00 a.m. local time\, be
 fore the Timed Research expires.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Ha
 lloween 2026\nGO Pass: Halloween 2026 is available from October 27 at 10:0
 0 a.m. to November 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, spanning both part
 s of Halloween. Trainers automatically receive the free pass when it begin
 s. Complete Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, increase your rank\, and ear
 n rewards.\nThe free pass includes:\n• Encounters with event-themed Pok
 émon\n• Candy for event-themed Pokémon\n• Rare Candy\n• Ultra Ball
 s\n• Additional rewards\nGO Pass Deluxe costs US$7.99 (or the equivalent
  local pricing tier). It offers faster progression and additional rewards\
 , including:\n• Additional encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n• Pa
 tissier Top and Patissier Pants\n• Rare Candy XL\n• Premium Battle Pas
 ses\n• Additional rewards\nFor US$9.99 (or the equivalent local pricing 
 tier)\, GO Pass Deluxe + 10 Ranks also provides enough GO Points to reach 
 Rank 11.\nDeluxe includes rewards from both tracks. You can upgrade at any
  time while the pass is available and claim rewards for ranks you have alr
 eady reached. Availability may vary by region.\nClaim all unlocked rewards
  by November 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, before they expire.\n\n
 ▸ Daily Tasks\nComplete these daily tasks to earn GO Points:\n• Catch 
 6 Ghost-type Pokémon — 50 GO Points\n• Catch 13 Pokémon — 50 GO Po
 ints\n\n▸ Extra Points\nEarn up to 500 extra GO Points daily by completi
 ng certain tasks:\n• Win a raid — 100 GO Points\n• Hatch an Egg — 
 40 GO Points\n• Catch a Pokémon — 5 GO Points\n\n▸ GO Pass: Hallowe
 en 2026\nRank up to encounter Rotom and Spiritomb and earn Halloween rewar
 ds!\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nPikachu wearing a hat and capelet\, Zubat wear
 ing a top hat\, and Sinistea wearing a bow will be available in their Shin
 y variants from their debut!\nPokémon: Pikachu wearing a hat and capelet\
 , Zubat wearing a top hat\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n\n🔗 https://leekduc
 k.com/events/halloween-2026-part-1/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/halloween-2026-part-1/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
