SUMMARY:Mega Sableye in Mega Raids
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261028T060000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261108T220000
DESCRIPTION:Mega Sableye will be in Mega Raids from October 28\, 2026 at 6 
