BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chandelure-super-mega-raid-day-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Chandelure Super Mega Raid Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261031T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261031T170000
DESCRIPTION:Mega Chandelure makes its Pokémon GO debut during Chandelure S
 uper Mega Raid Day on Saturday\, October 31\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:0
 0 p.m. local time!\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Remote Raid limit increas
 ed to 20 from Friday\, October 30\, at 5:00 p.m. to Saturday\, October 31\
 , 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. PDT\n• Receive up to six free Raid Passes from spi
 nning Gym Photo Discs\n• Chandelure caught from Super Mega Raids will ha
 ve Mega Level 1 unlocked\n• Increased chance of encountering Shiny Chand
 elure from Super Mega Raids\n\n▸ Event Ticket\nFor US$4.99 (or the equiv
 alent pricing tier in your local currency)\, you can purchase a ticket tha
 t grants the following bonuses.\n• Receive up to 14 Raid Passes from spi
 nning Gym Photo Discs\n• Increased chance to get Rare Candy XL from Raid
  Battles\n• An additional 5\,000 XP from Super Mega Raid Battles\n• An
  additional 5\,000 Stardust from Super Mega Raid Battles\nThese bonuses wi
 ll be effective on Saturday\, October 31\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p
 .m. local time.\nTickets can be gifted to friends at Great Friends or high
 er. Purchases\, including gifts\, are non-refundable\, subject to applicab
 le law and the Terms of Service. Tickets cannot be purchased with PokéCoi
 ns.\nThe in-game ticket will be available until Saturday\, October 31\, 20
 26\, at 5:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Mega Chandelu
 re Debut\nMega Chandelure\, a Ghost- and Fire-type Pokémon\, will make it
 s Pokémon GO debut in Super Mega Raids.\nPokémon: Mega Chandelure\n\n▸
  New Mega Level: Super Max\nMega Chandelure can reach Super Max Level for 
 the first time. Raise its Mega Level to Max first\, then use Chandelure Me
 ga Energy to reach Super Max. Mega Evolving alone will not be enough\; par
 ticipating in Mega Raids provides the additional Mega Energy you need.\n\n
 ▸ Ominous Wind+\nChandelure can use the additional Charged Attack Ominou
 s Wind+ while Mega Evolved.\n• Trainer Battles: 50 power\, with a chance
  to raise the user’s Attack and Defense by one stage.\n• Gyms and Raid
 s: 145 power.\nThe attack becomes more powerful as Chandelure’s Mega Lev
 el increases.\n\n▸ Global Challenge\nComplete Raid Battles alongside Tra
 iners worldwide to finish Global Challenge tiers. The challenge runs from 
 Friday\, October 30\, at 5:00 p.m. to Saturday\, October 31\, 2026\, at 8:
 00 p.m. PDT.\nThe completed tiers determine the strength of the following 
 rewards\, available from Monday\, November 2\, at 12:00 p.m. to Sunday\, N
 ovember 15\, 2026\, at 12:00 p.m. PST:\n• Mega Chandelure at Mega Level 
 1 or higher will receive a boost to Ominous Wind+’s base power. This bon
 us does not apply in GO Battle League.\n• Mega Chandelure at Super Max L
 evel will receive a CP boost.\nCompleting more tiers increases the boosts.
  Exact boost amounts have not been announced.\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ 
 Featured Pokémon\nMega Chandelure will appear in Super Mega Raids. After 
 defeating it\, Trainers can encounter Chandelure with Mega Level 1 unlocke
 d.\nPokémon: Mega Chandelure\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nTimed Research wi
 ll be available during the event\, with rewards including one Premium Batt
 le Pass and an encounter with Tyranitar.\nThe tasks and other rewards belo
 w are expected based on Staraptor Super Mega Raid Day and will be confirme
 d when the event begins.\nComplete the Timed Research tasks and claim thei
 r rewards before the research expires.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nTrainers wi
 ll have an increased chance of encountering Shiny Chandelure from Super Me
 ga Raids.\nPokémon: Chandelure\, Mega Chandelure\n\n🔗 https://leekduck
 .com/events/chandelure-super-mega-raid-day-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/chandelure-super-mega-raid-day-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
