BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:halloween-2026-part-2@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Halloween 2026 Part II
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261101T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261105T200000
DESCRIPTION:Shiny Greavard makes its Pokémon GO debut\, and Mega Sableye c
 an reach the new Super Max Mega Level! Halloween continues with costumed P
 okémon\, themed encounters\, and GO Pass bonuses.\nHalloween 2026 Part II
  runs from Sunday\, November 1\, at 10:00 a.m. to Thursday\, November 5\, 
 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\nSee Halloween 2026 Part I for the first p
 art of the celebration\, including the debut of costumed Pikachu\, Zubat\,
  and Sinistea.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\nReach Major Milestones on GO Pass
 : Halloween 2026 to unlock these bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 10\n• 2
 × Candy for catching Pokémon\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Candy for catching
  Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 2 – Rank 20\n• 2× Stardust for catching Pokémo
 n\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Stardust for catching Pokémon\nComplete the Bo
 nus Tasks in the GO Pass section to earn extra GO Points toward these mile
 stones.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Mega Sableye: Super Max Level\nStar
 ting with this event\, Mega Sableye can reach Super Max Level for the firs
 t time in Pokémon GO.\nPokémon: Mega Sableye\nFirst\, increase Sableye
 ’s Mega Level to Max\, the third level. To progress to Super Max\, you
 ’ll need to use Sableye Mega Energy to power it up\; Mega Evolving alone
  is not enough.\n\n▸ Night Shade+\nSableye can now use the additional Ch
 arged Attack Night Shade+ while Mega Evolved. Its power increases with the
  Pokémon’s Mega Level.\n• Trainer Battles: 55 power\n• Raid Battles
 : 160 power\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following Pokémon will appear mo
 re frequently in the wild.\nPokémon: Shuppet\, Litwick\, Froakie wearing 
 a Pokémon Halloween costume\, Rowlet wearing a Pokémon Halloween costume
 \, Sandygast\, Greavard\nIf you’re lucky\, you might encounter:\nPokémo
 n: Gengar wearing a Spooky Festival costume\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ On
 e-Star Raids\nThe following Pokémon will appear in one-star raids.\nPoké
 mon: Pikachu wearing a hat and capelet\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n\n━━ 
 RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research\nComplete event-themed Field Research 
 tasks for encounters with Rowlet and Froakie wearing Pokémon Halloween co
 stumes\, Pikachu wearing a hat and capelet\, Sinistea wearing a bow\, Grea
 vard\, and more! You can also earn Sableye Mega Energy.\n• Catch 13 Pok
 émon → Sableye Mega Energy ×13\n• Catch 13 Ghost‑type Pokémon →
  Halloween Costume Rowlet\, Greavard\, Halloween Costume Froakie\n• Make
  6 Nice Throws → Litwick\, Sandygast\, Greavard\n• Win a raid → Zuba
 t wearing a top hat\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n• Win 3 raids → Pikachu 
 wearing a hat and capelet\nFree Timed Research will be available during th
 e event. Its tasks will be automatically completed for all Trainers.\nRewa
 rds include:\n• 6 Rare Candies\n• An encounter with Sinistea wearing a
  bow\nClaim all rewards before Thursday\, November 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m.
  local time\, before the Timed Research expires.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\
 n▸ GO Pass: Halloween 2026\nThe same Halloween GO Pass continues through
  Part II. It is available from October 27 at 10:00 a.m. to November 5\, 20
 26\, at 8:00 p.m. local time. Trainers automatically receive the free pass
  when it begins. Complete Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, increase your 
 rank\, and unlock rewards. Greavard is among the Pokémon you can encounte
 r through GO Pass tasks.\nThe free pass includes:\n• Encounters with eve
 nt-themed Pokémon\n• Candy for event-themed Pokémon\n• Rare Candy\n
 • Ultra Balls\n• Additional rewards\nGO Pass Deluxe costs US$7.99 (or 
 the equivalent local pricing tier). It offers faster progression and addit
 ional rewards\, including:\n• Additional encounters with event-themed Po
 kémon\n• Patissier Top and Patissier Pants\n• Rare Candy XL\n• Prem
 ium Battle Passes\n• Additional rewards\nFor US$9.99 (or the equivalent 
 local pricing tier)\, GO Pass Deluxe + 10 Ranks also provides enough GO Po
 ints to reach Rank 11.\nDeluxe includes rewards from both tracks. You can 
 upgrade at any time while the pass is available and claim rewards for rank
 s you have already reached. Availability may vary by region.\nClaim all un
 locked rewards by November 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, before the
 y expire.\n\n▸ Daily Tasks\nComplete these daily tasks to earn GO Points
 :\n• Catch 6 Ghost-type Pokémon — 50 GO Points\n• Catch 13 Pokémon
  — 50 GO Points\n\n▸ Bonus Tasks\nComplete these Bonus Tasks before Th
 ursday\, November 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time to earn GO Points:\n
 • Catch 31 Ghost-type Pokémon — 200 GO Points\n• Catch 66 Pokémon 
 — 200 GO Points\n• Win 2 raids — 200 GO Points\n\n▸ Extra Points\n
 Earn up to 500 extra GO Points daily by completing certain tasks:\n• Win
  a raid — 100 GO Points\n• Hatch an Egg — 40 GO Points\n• Catch a 
 Pokémon — 5 GO Points\n\n▸ GO Pass: Halloween 2026\n…\n\n━━ SHI
 NY ━━\nShiny Greavard makes its Pokémon GO debut! You may encounter i
 t in the wild or through GO Pass and Field Research tasks.\nPokémon: Grea
 vard\, Houndstone\, Pikachu wearing a hat and capelet\, Sinistea wearing a
  bow\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/halloween-2026-part-2/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/halloween-2026-part-2/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
