 2:00 p.m. to 1:00 p.m. 2:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m. 4:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.\nPok
 émon: Alolan Sandshrew\, Alolan Diglett\, Magnemite\, Shellder\, Onix\, P
