SUMMARY:Pokémon Night Out 2026 - London
DTSTART:20261110T180000Z
DTEND:20261110T223000Z
DESCRIPTION:Unconfirmed Pokémon GO hours: The times shown are based on the
  Pokémon Night Out event schedule\, beginning when doors open. Pokémon G
 O gameplay hours have not been confirmed\, and the event may run at differ
 ent times.\nCelebrate Pokémon Night Out with special Pokémon GO gameplay
  for attendees at the venue!\nDate: November 10\, 2026 Location: O2 Arena\
 , London\, England Night Out event hours: 6:00 p.m. – 10:30 p.m. GMT (un
 confirmed for Pokémon GO)\nThe O2 listing gives a doors-open time of 6:00
  p.m.\, and its official calendar lists an end time of 10:30 p.m. The conc
 ert’s performance start time is not specified.\n\n▸ Related Events\n\n
 ━━ BONUSES ━━\nAttendees can enjoy the following bonus during the 
 event.\n• Lure Modules activated during the event last for one hour\, ex
 cluding Golden Lure Modules\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThese Pokémon will a
 ppear more often in the wild at the event venue.\nPokémon: Gastly\, Volto
 rb\, Alolan Marowak\, Hoothoot\, Murkrow\, Houndour\, Electrike\, Carvanha
 \, Shinx\, Zorua\, Joltik\, Froakie\, Dedenne\, Rookidee\nYou may also enc
 ounter these rarer Pokémon.\nPokémon: Unown P\, Unown N\, Unown O\n\n━
 ━ RAIDS ━━\nPikachu and Gengar caught from these event raids will ha
 ve a London Location Background.\n\n▸ One-Star Raids\nPokémon: Pikachu\
 n\n▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Gengar\nBoth raid Pokémon can be Shiny
 .\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Timed Research\nOpen Pokémon GO at the v
 enue to receive up to two Timed Research opportunities. Rewards include en
 counters with event-themed Pokémon\, such as Low Key Form or Amped Form T
 oxtricity\, and a Pokémon Night Out baseball jersey avatar item.\n\n▸ F
 eatured Research Encounters\nPokémon: Toxtricity (Low Key Form)\, Toxtric
 ity (Amped Form)\nIf you already claimed the avatar item Timed Research th
 rough the Los Angeles Twitch livestream\, you will not receive that resear
 ch again.\nResearch tasks and completion deadlines have not been announced
 .\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-night-out-london-2026/
