DESCRIPTION:The Great League\, Ultra League: Mega Edition\, and 2026 GO LAI
 C Cup will run from November 10\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. to November 17\, 202
 6\, at 1:00 p.m. PT.\n\n▸ Great League\n• Pokémon must be at or below
  1\,500 CP to enter.\n\n▸ Ultra League: Mega Edition\n• Pokémon must 
 be at or below 2\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are allowed.
 \n\n▸ 2026 GO LAIC Cup\n• Pokémon must be at or below 1\,500 CP to en
 ter.\n• Fire-\, Dark-\, Steel-\, and Fairy-type Pokémon are not eligibl
 e.\n• Legendary Pokémon\, Mythical Pokémon\, and Ultra Beasts are not 
 eligible.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are not eligible for the GO Battle Le
 ague version of this Cup. However\, Mega-Evolved Pokémon will be eligible
  for the Pokémon Latin America International Championships 2026 in-person
  competition.\nThe following Pokémon will not be allowed.\nPokémon: Chan
 sey\, Snorlax\, Furret\, Wobbuffet\, Galarian Corsola\, Kingdra\, Medicham
 \, Altaria\, Dusclops\, Jellicent\, Araquanid\, Oranguru\, Annihilape\, Cl
 odsire\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/gbl-twilight-trails_great-leagu
 e_ultra-league-mega-edition_2026-go-laic-cup/
