 IC Cup will run from November 18\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. to November 25\, 20
 26\, at 1:00 p.m. PT.\nTrainers will also receive 4× Stardust from win re
 wards (this does not include end-of-set rewards).\n\n▸ Ultra League\n•
  Pokémon must be at or below 2\,500 CP to enter.\n\n▸ Master League: Me
 ga Edition\n• No CP limit.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are allowed.\n\n
 ▸ 2026 GO LAIC Cup\n• Pokémon must be at or below 1\,500 CP to enter.
 \n• Fire-\, Dark-\, Steel-\, and Fairy-type Pokémon are not eligible.\n
 • Legendary Pokémon\, Mythical Pokémon\, and Ultra Beasts are not elig
 ible.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are not eligible for the GO Battle League
  version of this Cup. However\, Mega-Evolved Pokémon will be eligible for
  the Pokémon Latin America International Championships 2026 in-person com
 petition.\nThe following Pokémon will not be allowed.\nPokémon: Chansey\
 , Snorlax\, Furret\, Wobbuffet\, Galarian Corsola\, Kingdra\, Medicham\, A
 ltaria\, Dusclops\, Jellicent\, Araquanid\, Oranguru\, Annihilape\, Clodsi
