 cal time.\n\n▸ Related Events\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\nThe following bo
 nuses will be active during the event.\n• Power Spots will refresh more 
 frequently\n• Max Particle collection limit increased to 2\,400\n• 8×
  Max Particles from Power Spots\nThe daily Remote Raid limit will increase
  from 10 to 30 from November 20 at 1 pm to November 21 at 6 pm PST (GMT 
 −8).\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Eternamax Eternatus in Max Battles\n
 Pokémon: Eternamax Eternatus\nDefeat Eternamax Eternatus in Max Battles t
 o earn a large amount of Eternatus Candy and Eternatus Candy XL. Eternamax
  Eternatus cannot be caught after these battles.\n\n▸ Encounter Eternatu
 s through GO Pass\nEternatus is available through GO Pass: Dynamax Trails.
  Trainers who have already caught Eternatus will receive 100 Eternatus Can
 dy instead of another encounter.\nBoth the free GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe
  provide Eternatus Candy and Candy XL to help power it up.\n\n🔗 https:/
 /leekduck.com/events/eternamax-eternatus-max-battles-2026/
