BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:november-communityday2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Pawniard Community Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261121T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261121T170000
DESCRIPTION:Pawniard\, the Sharp Blade Pokémon\, will be featured during N
 ovember Community Day!\nThe event takes place on Saturday\, November 21\, 
 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n
 • Increased Spawns\n• 1/4 Egg Hatch Distance\n• 3-hour Incense\n• 
 1-hour Lures*\n• 2x Catch Candy\n• 2x Chance for Trainers level 31 and
  up to receive Candy XL from catching Pokémon\n• One additional Special
  Trade can be made for a maximum of two for the day*\n• Trades made will
  require 50% less Stardust*\nThe reduced Egg Hatch Distance applies to Egg
 s placed in an Incubator during the event.\n* While most bonuses are only 
 active from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time\, these bonuses will be acti
 ve from 2:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time.\nThe three-hour Incense bonus e
 xcludes Daily Adventure Incense and the one-hour Lure bonus excludes Golde
 n Lure Modules.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Featured Attack\nEvolve Bis
 harp during the event or up to four hours afterwards to get a Kingambit th
 at knows the Charged Attack Kowtow Cleave.\n\n▸ Kowtow Cleave (Dark-type
 )\n• Trainer Battles: 75 power\n• Gyms and raids: 85 power\n\n▸ Limi
 ted-time Evolution Requirement\nFrom 2:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time\, e
 volve Bisharp into Kingambit after defeating 1 Dark- or Steel-type Raid Bo
 ss with Bisharp as your Buddy Pokémon.\nThis bonus only applies to the Bi
 sharp that is your Buddy Pokémon. The usual evolution requirements return
  on Saturday\, November 21\, 2026\, at 9:00 p.m. local time.\nCorrection (
 October 28\, 2026): This page previously stated that the evolution bonus a
 pplied to all of your Bisharp\, regardless of whether they were your Buddy
  Pokémon. That was incorrect\; Bisharp must be your Buddy Pokémon for th
 e bonus to apply.\n\n▸ Photobomb\nTake a few snapshots during Community 
 Day for a surprise! During the event\, you can snap an AR Photo and get ph
 otobombed by Pawniard.\nPokémon: Pawniard\n\n▸ Lure Module Bonus\nFrom 
 2:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time\, Pawniard will have a very high chance 
 of appearing at PokéStops with active regular Lure Modules.\nPawniard att
 racted to regular Lure Modules will still have an increased chance to be S
 hiny and may have a Special Background. That’s more chances to encounter
  the featured Pokémon even after the event hours!\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━
 \nPawniard will appear more frequently in the wild. If you’re lucky\, yo
 u might encounter a Shiny one or one that has a Special Background!\nPoké
 mon: Pawniard\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Tasks\nNovembe
 r Community Day–themed Field Research will be available! Catch Pawniard 
 to earn rewards such as Stardust\, Ultra Balls\, additional encounters wit
 h Pawniard\, and more! You may even find Field Research that leads to enco
 unters with Pawniard that have a Special Background—if you’re lucky!\n
 • Catch 3 Pawniard → Pawniard\, Great Ball ×5\, Ultra Ball ×2\, Pina
 p Berry ×2\, Stardust ×500\nThe following tasks will have encounters wit
 h Special Backgrounds.\n• Catch 5 Pokemon while in a Party → Pawniard\
 n• Catch 50 Pokemon → Pawniard\nFor US$1.99 (or the equivalent pricing
  tier in your local currency)\, you’ll be able to access the Pawniard Co
 mmunity Day–exclusive Special Research. Complete this research for rewar
 ds including:\n• 3 encounters with Pawniard that have a Special Backgrou
 nd\n• Additional encounters with Pawniard\n• 1 Premium Battle Pass\n
 • 1 Rare Candy XL\n• And more!\nYou can purchase and gift tickets to f
 riends you’ve achieved a Friendship level of Great Friends or higher wit
 h. To gift a ticket\, tap the Special Research ticket in the in-game shop\
 , then tap the Gift button instead of the Buy button.\n\n▸ Community Amb
 assador Check-In Timed Research\nCheck in at a Community Ambassador event 
 to receive Timed Research with Pawniard encounters featuring a Special Bac
 kground and other premium item rewards. Find a nearby meetup on the Pokém
 on GO event map.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nTrainers will have an increased c
 hance of encountering Shiny Pawniard during Community Day. Shiny Pawniard 
 can be evolved into Shiny Bisharp and Shiny Kingambit.\nPokémon: Pawniard
 \, Bisharp\, Kingambit\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/november-commun
 ityday2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/november-communityday2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
