SUMMARY:Twilight Wishes
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261124T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261130T200000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Twilight Wishes with Espeon wearing a sun scarf\, Umb
 reon wearing a moon scarf\, and Rockruff! Enjoy increased chances to encou
 nter Shiny Staryu and Shiny Elgyem\, event-themed raids and Field Research
 \, and rewards and bonuses from the event GO Pass.\nTwilight Wishes runs f
 rom Tuesday\, November 24\, at 10:00 a.m. to Monday\, November 30\, 2026\,
  at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased chance t
 o encounter Shiny Staryu and Shiny Elgyem\nReach Major Milestones on the e
 vent GO Pass to unlock the following bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 1\n
 • Increased chance to get Lucky Pokémon in trades\n• Increased chance
  to become Lucky Friends\n\n▸ Tier 2 – Rank 10\n• 2× Stardust for c
 atching Pokémon\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Stardust for catching Pokémon\n
 Additional bonus tasks for the event GO Pass will be available during the 
 event.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Featured Pokémon\nEspeon wearing a 
 sun scarf\, Umbreon wearing a moon scarf\, and Rockruff are featured durin
 g Twilight Wishes. All three can be Shiny if you’re lucky!\nPokémon: Es
 peon wearing a sun scarf\, Umbreon wearing a moon scarf\, Rockruff\n\n▸ 
 Explore with Decor\nStars will light up the in-game skies during Twilight 
 Wishes\, with colorful decor to enjoy as you explore.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━
 ━\nThe following Pokémon will appear in the wild\, along with other eve
 nt-themed Pokémon.\nPokémon: Clefairy\, Staryu\, Elgyem\nIf you’re luc
 ky\, you might also encounter Rockruff!\nPokémon: Rockruff\nStaryu and El
 gyem have an increased chance of being Shiny during the event.\n\n━━ R
 AIDS ━━\n▸ One-Star Raids\nPokémon: Pikachu wearing a sun crown\, P
 ikachu wearing a moon crown\n\n▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Espeon wear
 ing a sun scarf\, Umbreon wearing a moon scarf\n\n▸ Mega Raids\nPokémon
 : Mega Beedrill\, Mega Houndoom\, Mega Sableye\, Mega Manectric\n\n━━ 
 RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Task Rewards\nComplete event-themed Fi
 eld Research tasks to earn Mega Energy and encounters with event-themed Po
 kémon\, including Staryu\, Elgyem\, and more!\nPokémon: Staryu\, Elgyem\
 nCelebrate the Twilight Trails Season finale with additional encounters fe
 aturing Pokémon from throughout the Season. These Field Research rewards 
 change during the event.\n\n▸ November 24 at 10:00 a.m. to November 26 a
 t 10:00 a.m. local time\nPokémon: Applin\, Maschiff\n\n▸ November 26 at
  10:00 a.m. to November 30 at 8:00 p.m. local time\nPokémon: Gengar weari
 ng a Spooky Festival costume\, Drifblim wearing a Halloween Mischief costu
 me\, Bramblin\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Twilight Wishes\nGO P
 ass: Twilight Wishes and GO Pass Deluxe are available from Tuesday\, Novem
 ber 24\, at 10:00 a.m. to Monday\, November 30\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local
  time. Trainers automatically receive the free pass when it begins. Comple
 te Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, increase your rank\, and earn rewards
 .\nGO Pass Deluxe costs US$4.99 (or the equivalent local pricing tier). It
  offers upgraded rewards and faster progression.\nFor US$6.99 (or the equi
 valent local pricing tier)\, GO Pass Deluxe + 6 Ranks also provides enough
  GO Points to reach Rank 7.\nDeluxe includes rewards from both tracks. You
  can upgrade while the pass is available and claim rewards from ranks you 
 have already unlocked. Availability may vary by region.\nClaim all unlocke
 d rewards by Wednesday\, December 2\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, bef
 ore they expire.\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon and Rewards\nThe event GO Pass f
 eatures the following rewards:\n• Encounters with event-themed Pokémon\
 n• Star Piece\n• Rare Candy\n• Mega Energy for Beedrill\, Houndoom\,
  Sableye\, and Manectric\n• Additional rewards\nTrainers who upgrade to 
 GO Pass Deluxe can also earn:\n• Additional encounters with event-themed
  Pokémon\n• An event-themed avatar pose\n• Star Pieces\n• Premium B
 attle Passes\n• Additional rewards\nReach Major Milestones to unlock the
  Lucky Pokémon\, Lucky Friends\, and catch Stardust bonuses listed in the
  Bonuses section.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/twilight-wishes-2026
 /
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/twilight-wishes-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
