BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:clefable-super-mega-raid-day-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Clefable Super Mega Raid Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261128T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261128T170000
DESCRIPTION:Mega Clefable makes its Pokémon GO debut during Clefable Super
  Mega Raid Day on Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p
 .m. local time!\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Remote Raid limit increased 
 to 20 from Friday\, November 27\, at 5:00 p.m. to Saturday\, November 28\,
  2026\, at 8:00 p.m. PST\n• Receive up to six free Raid Passes from spin
 ning Gym Photo Discs\n• Clefable caught from Super Mega Raids will have 
 Mega Level 1 unlocked\n• Increased chance of encountering Shiny Clefable
  from Super Mega Raids\n\n▸ Event Ticket\nFor US$4.99 (or the equivalent
  pricing tier in your local currency)\, you can purchase a ticket that gra
 nts the following bonuses.\n• Receive up to 14 Raid Passes from spinning
  Gym Photo Discs\n• Increased chance to get Rare Candy XL from Raid Batt
 les\n• An additional 5\,000 XP from Super Mega Raid Battles\n• An addi
 tional 5\,000 Stardust from Super Mega Raid Battles\nThese bonuses will be
  effective on Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. 
 local time.\nTickets can be gifted to friends at Great Friends or higher. 
 Purchases\, including gifts\, are non-refundable\, subject to applicable l
 aw and the Terms of Service. Tickets cannot be purchased with PokéCoins.\
 nThe in-game ticket will be available until Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\
 , at 5:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Mega Clefable De
 but\nMega Clefable\, a Fairy- and Flying-type Pokémon\, will make its Pok
 émon GO debut in Super Mega Raids.\n\n▸ New Mega Level: Super Max\nMega
  Clefable can reach Super Max Level for the first time. Raise its Mega Lev
 el to Max first\, then use Clefable Mega Energy to reach Super Max. Mega E
 volving alone will not be enough\; participating in Mega Raids provides th
 e additional Mega Energy you need.\n\n▸ Moonblast+\nClefable can use the
  additional Charged Attack Moonblast+ while Mega Evolved.\n• Trainer Bat
 tles: 80 power\, with a chance to reduce the opponent’s Attack by one st
 age.\n• Raid Battles: 160 power.\nThe attack becomes more powerful as Cl
 efable’s Mega Level increases.\n\n▸ Global Challenge\nComplete Raid Ba
 ttles alongside Trainers worldwide to finish Global Challenge tiers. The c
 hallenge runs from Friday\, November 27\, at 5:00 p.m. to Saturday\, Novem
 ber 28\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. PST.\nThe completed tiers determine the stren
 gth of the following rewards\, available from Monday\, November 30\, at 12
 :00 p.m. to Sunday\, December 13\, 2026\, at 12:00 p.m. PST:\n• Mega Cle
 fable at Mega Level 1 or higher will receive a boost to Moonblast+’s bas
 e power. This bonus does not apply in GO Battle League.\n• Mega Clefable
  at Super Max Level will receive a CP boost.\nCompleting more tiers increa
 ses the boosts. Exact boost amounts have not been announced.\n\n▸ Where 
 can I find Super Mega Raids?\nSuper Mega Raids may only appear at certain 
 Gyms and require teamwork. Use the Pokémon GO Map to find potential raid 
 locations and raids already in progress. You can also check nearby communi
 ty meetups in advance to coordinate with other Trainers.\n\n━━ RAIDS 
 ━━\n▸ Featured Pokémon\nMega Clefable will appear in Super Mega Rai
 ds. After defeating it\, Trainers can encounter Clefable with Mega Level 1
  unlocked.\n\n▸ Encounter after defeating Mega Clefable\nPokémon: Clefa
 ble\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nTimed Research will be available during the
  event\, with rewards including one Premium Battle Pass and an encounter w
 ith Metagross.\nThe tasks and other rewards below are expected based on Ch
 andelure Super Mega Raid Day and will be confirmed when the event begins.\
 nComplete the Timed Research tasks and claim their rewards before the rese
 arch expires.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nTrainers will have an increased chan
 ce of encountering Shiny Clefable from Super Mega Raids.\nPokémon: Clefab
 le\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/clefable-super-mega-raid-day-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/clefable-super-mega-raid-day-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
