UID:pokemon-go-tour-alola-kaohsiung-2027@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T105116Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Tour: Alola - Kaohsiung 2027
DTSTART:20270218T160000Z
DTEND:20270221T155959Z
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon GO Tour returns in February 2027 to celebrate the Alol
 a region from Pokémon Sun\, Pokémon Moon\, Pokémon Ultra Sun\, and Pok
 émon Ultra Moon.\nDates: February 19–21\, 2027 Location: Kaohsiung\, Ta
 iwan Event hours: To be announced\nJoin fellow Trainers for a real-world P
 okémon GO Tour event with special in-person gameplay.\nTickets for the in
 -person experiences and the global in-game event will be available next Se
