 ━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased Stardust for catching Minior\n• Inc
 reased chance to encounter Minior from 5:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time e
 ach day\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Minior Cores\nMinior has seven diff
 erent core colors: Red\, Orange\, Yellow\, Green\, Blue\, Indigo\, and Vio
 let. A different core color will debut during each of the six meteor showe
 rs listed below. During the Geminids\, one core color will debut in the No
 rthern Hemisphere and another in the Southern Hemisphere.\nPokémon: Minio
 r (Red Core)\, Minior (Orange Core)\, Minior (Yellow Core)\, Minior (Green
